<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1820] Deployment service hangs when node is being stopped.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1820</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Node hangs when a Service is being deployed on a node from one thread and at the same time the same node is being stopped from the other thread.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See the reproducer example &lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12769777/12769777_ServicesDeadlock.java&quot; title=&quot;ServicesDeadlock.java attached to IGNITE-1820&quot;&gt;ServicesDeadlock.java&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12909205">IGNITE-1820</key>
            <summary>Deployment service hangs when node is being stopped.</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
